  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542751371-adc38448a05e?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
  "keyPoints": {
    "en": [
      "Weapon reach and sharpness are the two most critical weapon stats—sharpness below Blue tier reduces damage by 25% through the sharpness multiplier; maintain Blue or better before any major monster engagement.",
      "Iceborne's Clutch Claw system enables forced wall splats and wound creation on all parts—use the Claw to wound the part with the highest DPS multiplier (usually the head or weakest spot) before starting your main combo rotation.",
      "Set bonuses in World/Iceborne require matching armour pieces from the same monster family—Nergigante 4-piece (Grudge Match skill) and Teostra 2-piece (Master's Touch—prevents sharpness loss on critical hits) are the two most universally used set bonuses across all weapon types.",
      "Investigations are the most efficient path for endgame gear—prioritise gold-reward investigations over silver for higher chances of rare material drops; investigation slots refresh per in-game day.",
      "The Safi'jiiva siege event (multiplayer, 4 players) provides the strongest base weapons in the game through its weapon awakening system—fully awakened Safi weapons exceed Alatreon/Fatalis weapons on most weapon types before augmentation."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "武器のリーチと切れ味は最も重要な武器ステータスの2つ。切れ味が青以下になると切れ味乗数により25%ダメージが減少する。主要なモンスターエンゲージメントの前に青以上を維持する。",
      "アイスボーンのクラッチクローシステムは全てのパーツへの強制壁張り付きと傷付けを可能にする。主要コンボローテーションを始める前に最高DPS乗数を持つパーツ（通常は頭か最も弱いスポット）に傷を付けるためにクローを使用する。",
      "ワールド/アイスボーンのセットボーナスは同じモンスターファミリーのマッチングした防具パーツを必要とする。ネルギガンテ4ピース（怨み持続スキル）とテオ・テスカトル2ピース（マスターの閃光——クリティカルヒット時の切れ味損失を防ぐ）は全武器タイプ中で最も広く使用されているセットボーナス。",
      "ヘミングウェーは終盤の装備の最も効率的な経路。銀より金報酬の調査を優先すると希少素材のドロップ確率が高くなる。調査スロットはゲーム内日付ごとにリフレッシュされる。",
      "サフィ=ジーヴァの討伐イベント（マルチプレイヤー、4人）はゲーム最強のベース武器を武器覚醒システムで提供する。完全に覚醒したサフィ武器は強化前の多くの武器タイプでアルバトリオン/廻り世の最強武器を上回る。"
    ]
  },
  "opening": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Weapon Selection for New Hunters",
        "body": "The Sword and Shield is the recommended entry weapon for new hunters—it allows item use without sheathing, has the shortest total animation commitment per attack, and its Critical Draw combo (sheath, draw attack, combo) is viable against every monster in the game. Alternatively, the Longsword provides the Spirit Gauge system that rewards sustained aggression with damage multipliers. Both weapons have the shortest learning curve to effective damage output. Avoid Charge Blade and Insect Glaive as starting weapons—their systems require understanding of base game mechanics before the extra complexity adds value."
      },
      {
        "title": "Great Jagras to Zorah Magdaros Route",
        "body": "The mandatory investigation route in Low Rank unlocks the Defender armour set (if installed)—use Defender armour exclusively for Low Rank to access High Rank faster. High Rank begins at Elder Recess (HR 8+); the High Rank armour and weapons provide 2× the stats of Low Rank equivalents. Speed through Low Rank using Defender gear, then invest crafting time in High Rank monster sets starting from Rathalos (HR Rathalos set provides Fire Resistance and Attack Boost nodes essential for the mid-game weapon upgrade tree)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "midGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Iceborne Clutch Claw Integration",
        "body": "Clutch Claw (Iceborne feature) attaches Wolf directly to the monster for wound creation or wall slam. The wound creation mechanic: clutch the monster's target body part, use the weapon-specific Claw Attack (Clutch Claw Weapon Attack is specific to each weapon type), and then detach to proc the wound. Wounded parts take 10% extra damage for the duration of the hunt until the wound seals. Against Elder Dragons (non-slammable), the Clutch Claw Weapon Attack is the only wound source and must be executed every 90 seconds to maintain wound coverage."
      },
      {
        "title": "Master Rank Armor Priority",
        "body": "The optimal Master Rank armour progression path: craft Banbaro or Barioth set for early Master Rank (both provide base 300 defense without specific skills needed) → transition to Velkhana 4-piece (Critical Element + Frostcraft bonuses, best for elemental weapon users) or Brachydios 4-piece (Agitator + Slugger, best for impact weapons) depending on weapon type. Both mid-game sets carry to the endgame with augmentation; do not wait for Fatalis armour before committing to a set."
      }
    ]
  },
  "endGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Alatreon and Fatalis Preparation",
        "body": "Alatreon requires matching elemental damage output to prevent its Escaton Judgment wipe attack—this forces element-based weapon selection over raw damage builds. Prepare two sets of elemental weapons (Fire and Ice for the two Alatreon variants) and armour with maximum elemental resistance. Fatalis requires a different strategy: it deals fixed-damage fire bursts that bypass elemental resistance. The optimal Fatalis approach is maximum HP (50 Vitality Mantle use) and fire-resistant armour (Dragonbarbs layered with Protective Polish skill active)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mistakes": {
    "en": [
      "Using the same weapon against all monster types—elemental matching in World provides up to 20% additional damage; maintaining two weapon types (a raw damage option and an element-matched option per monster) significantly reduces hunt times.",
      "Ignoring monster tracking before engaging—Scoutflies track monsters passively once you have enough research data; entering a hunt without 4-star research level means spending the first 3 minutes searching rather than hunting.",
      "Forgetting Mantles recharge after use—Temporal, Rocksteady, and Ghillie Mantles recharge during hunts; using all mantles in the first encounter and forgetting they are available for a second use in the same quest is a common waste.",
      "Crafting decorations inefficiently—Jewels have fixed drop rates from Tempered Monster investigations; farming rank 3 tempered investigations (only available at HR 50+) provides the most efficient decoration acquisition.",
      "Attempting Arch-Tempered monsters without full augmentation—Arch-Tempered variants deal 200% increased damage; entering without at least one health boost augment on your armour and maximum sharpness on your weapon makes survivability near-impossible on most builds."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "全てのモンスタータイプに同じ武器を使う。ワールドの属性マッチングは最大20%の追加ダメージを提供する。2種類の武器タイプ（生の火力オプションとモンスターごとの属性マッチングオプション）を維持すると討伐時間が大幅に減少する。",
      "エンゲージメント前のモンスター追跡を無視する。調査データが十分にあれば翔蟲がパッシブでモンスターを追跡する。4つ星の調査レベルなしで狩猟に入ると、最初の3分を狩猟ではなく探索に費やすことになる。",
      "マントルが使用後にリチャージされることを忘れる。時間、岩盤、隠れ身マントルは狩猟中にリチャージされる。最初のエンカウントで全マントルを使用して、同じクエストで2回目に利用可能であることを忘れることは一般的な無駄遣い。",
      "装飾品を非効率に製造する。珠には調和のとれた魔獣の調査からの固定ドロップ率がある。ランク3の達人の調査（HR 50以上でのみ利用可能）のファーミングが最も効率的な装飾品の取得を提供する。",
      "完全な強化なしで歴戦王モンスターに挑む。歴戦王はダメージが200%増加する。防具に少なくとも1つの体力ブーストの強化と武器の最大切れ味なしで入ると、ほとんどのビルドで生存率がほぼ不可能になる。"
